          <rect
            height="16"
            rx="2"
            width="16"
            x="4"
            y="4"
          />
          <rect
            height="6"
            rx="1"
            width="6"
            x="9"
            y="9"
          />
          <path
            d="M15 2v2"
          />
          <path
            d="M15 20v2"
          />
          <path
            d="M2 15h2"
          />
          <path
            d="M2 9h2"
          />
          <path
            d="M20 15h2"
          />
          <path
            d="M20 9h2"
          />
          <path
            d="M9 2v2"
          />
          <path
            d="M9 20v2"
          />
        </svg>
        HUD Mode
      </h3>
      <p
        class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-4"
      >
        The dashboard's personality: JARVIS holds the line in cyan; ULTRON takes over in crimson.
      </p>
      <div
        class="card hud-frame p-5 space-y-4"
      >
        <div
          class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2"
        >
          <button
            aria-pressed="false"
            class="rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 border transition-colors text-center bg-surface-2 border-border text-gray-400 hover:bg-surface-3 hover:text-gray-200"
          >
            <span
              class="block font-wordmark text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.18em]"
            >
              JARVIS
            </span>
            <span
              class="block text-[10px] text-gray-500 mt-1"
            >
              Always cyan
            </span>
          </button>
          <button
            aria-pressed="true"
            class="rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 border transition-colors text-center bg-accent/15 border-accent/50 text-accent shadow-glow-sm"
          >
            <span
              class="block font-wordmark text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.18em]"
            >
              AUTO
            </span>
            <span
              class="block text-[10px] text-gray-500 mt-1"
            >
              Triggers decide
            </span>
          </button>
          <button
            aria-pressed="false"
            class="rounded-md px-3 py-2.5 border transition-colors text-center bg-surface-2 border-border text-gray-400 hover:bg-surface-3 hover:text-gray-200"
          >
            <span
              class="block font-wordmark text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.18em]"
            >
              ULTRON
            </span>
            <span
              class="block text-[10px] text-gray-500 mt-1"
            >
              Always crimson
            </span>
          </button>
        </div>
        <p
          class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 leading-relaxed"
        >
          In AUTO, ULTRON wakes on an error storm (3+ agent errors in 60s), a swarm (5+ agents running at once), or for 10s after you kill a run. Typing “ultron” anywhere summons him; typing “jarvis” restores order.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section
      class="scroll-mt-24"
      id="tabby"
    >
      <h3
        class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 flex items-center gap-2 mb-1"
      >
        <span
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="text-base leading-none"
