          ◉
        </span>
        Mini JARVIS companion
      </h3>
      <p
        class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-4"
      >
        A floating pocket core that watches your cursor and reacts to your live sessions.
      </p>
      <div
        class="card p-5"
      >
        <div
          class="flex items-center gap-3"
        >
          <div
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center transition-colors bg-surface-2 border border-border"
