    <section
      class="scroll-mt-24"
      id="voice"
    >
      <h3
        class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 flex items-center gap-2 mb-1"
      >
        <svg
          class="lucide lucide-mic w-4 h-4 text-gray-500"
          fill="none"
          height="24"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          stroke-width="2"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          width="24"
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        >
          <path
            d="M12 2a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v7a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V5a3 3 0 0 0-3-3Z"
          />
          <path
            d="M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2"
          />
          <line
            x1="12"
            x2="12"
            y1="19"
            y2="22"
          />
        </svg>
        Voice & Siri
      </h3>
      <p
        class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-4"
      >
        Talk to Jarvis from your phone or CarPlay via a Siri Shortcut. It calls POST /api/assistant/ask with one of the bearer tokens below and speaks the reply. See SETUP.md → “Voice control via Siri Shortcuts” for the step-by-step recipe.
      </p>
      <div
        class="card p-5 space-y-5"
      >
        <div
          class="flex items-start gap-3 text-xs text-gray-400"
        >
          <svg
            class="lucide lucide-globe w-4 h-4 text-gray-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"
            fill="none"
            height="24"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            stroke-width="2"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            width="24"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          >
            <circle
              cx="12"
              cy="12"
              r="10"
            />
            <path
              d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"
            />
            <path
              d="M2 12h20"
            />
          </svg>
          <div
            class="space-y-1"
          >
            <p>
              Endpoint (set this URL in your Shortcut):
            </p>
            <code
              class="block bg-surface-2 rounded px-2 py-1 text-cyan-300 break-all"
            >
              POST 
              http://localhost:3000
              /api/assistant/ask
            </code>
            <p
              class="text-[11px] text-gray-600"
            >
